---
import { Image, Code, Codeblock } from "@teseor/react";
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Image — Teseor">
  <main class="t-stack" data-gap="6">
    <h1>Image</h1>
    <p>Image primitive — styled `&lt;img&gt;` with token-driven defaults (rounded corners, loading-state background, optional `object-fit`). Native HTML attrs (`src`, `alt`, `width`, `height`, `loading`, `decoding`, `srcset`, `sizes`) pass through the inherited type.</p>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Examples</h2>
      <div class="t-stack" data-gap="2">
        <h3>default</h3>
        <div class="t-cluster" data-gap="3">
          <Image src="/img/sample-landscape.jpg" alt="Minimalist landscape of layered hills under a warm sky" />
        </div>
        <Codeblock>&lt;Image src="/img/sample-landscape.jpg" alt="Minimalist landscape of layered hills under a warm sky" /&gt;</Codeblock>
      </div>
      <div class="t-stack" data-gap="2">
        <h3>fit-cover</h3>
        <div class="t-cluster" data-gap="3">
          <Image src="/img/sample-landscape.jpg" alt="Minimalist landscape of layered hills under a warm sky" fit="cover" width={320} height={180} />
        </div>
        <Codeblock>&lt;Image src="/img/sample-landscape.jpg" alt="Minimalist landscape of layered hills under a warm sky" fit="cover" width=&lbrace;320&rbrace; height=&lbrace;180&rbrace; /&gt;</Codeblock>
      </div>
      <div class="t-stack" data-gap="2">
        <h3>fit-contain</h3>
        <div class="t-cluster" data-gap="3">
          <Image src="/img/sample-landscape.jpg" alt="Minimalist landscape of layered hills under a warm sky" fit="contain" width={320} height={180} />
        </div>
        <Codeblock>&lt;Image src="/img/sample-landscape.jpg" alt="Minimalist landscape of layered hills under a warm sky" fit="contain" width=&lbrace;320&rbrace; height=&lbrace;180&rbrace; /&gt;</Codeblock>
      </div>
      <div class="t-stack" data-gap="2">
        <h3>responsive-fit</h3>
        <div class="t-cluster" data-gap="3">
          <Image src="/img/sample-portrait.jpg" alt="Stylized portrait of tall grass against a warm sky" fit={{ base: "contain", md: "cover" }} width={320} height={180} />
        </div>
        <Codeblock>&lt;Image src="/img/sample-portrait.jpg" alt="Stylized portrait of tall grass against a warm sky" fit=&lbrace;&lbrace; base: "contain", md: "cover" &rbrace;&rbrace; width=&lbrace;320&rbrace; height=&lbrace;180&rbrace; /&gt;</Codeblock>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Props</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Responsive</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><Code>fit</Code></td><td><Code>string</Code></td><td>✓</td><td><Code>null</Code></td><td>Maps to `object-fit`. Absence-of-attr leaves the default (`fill`). Responsive form (`&lbrace; base, sm, md, … &rbrace;`) emits per-breakpoint `data-fit-&lbrace;bp&rbrace;` attrs for art-direction without `&lt;picture&gt;`.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Tokens</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Token</th><th>Fallback</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-image-radius</Code></td><td><Code>--t-radius-md</Code></td><td>Corner rounding of the image box.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-image-bg</Code></td><td><Code>--t-surface-muted</Code></td><td>Background color shown while the image loads or for transparent images.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Forced colors</h2>
      <p>In Windows High Contrast mode, the component remaps these semantic tokens to CSS system colors. Custom-property inheritance carries the values to every reference in the subtree.</p>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Token</th><th>Default</th><th>Forced-colors</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-surface-muted</Code></td><td><Code>oklch(from oklch(from oklch(58% 0.2 268deg) 50% calc(c * 0.025) h) 92% c h)</Code></td><td><Code>Canvas</Code></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Bundle size</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Artifact</th><th>Raw</th><th>Gzip</th><th>Brotli</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><a href="https://github.com/teseor/teseor/blob/main/packages/css/src/components/image/image.css"><Code>@teseor/css/components/image.css</Code></a></td><td>0.88 KB</td><td>0.43 KB</td><td>0.35 KB</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
